  "format": "call-of-slop-construct-part/1",
  "name": "Foundry",
  "description": "A Foundry Core: mixes materials into new ones, up to four at once (metal and stone to steel, stone and sand to concrete, planks and glass to laminate, planks and sand to rubber, copper and metal to bronze, copper and gold to circuits, steel and bronze to ammo): a chute for each into its hoppers. On its own it makes 2 steel a second. Weld Crucible Blocks on its +x side: they split into square crucibles (1 x 1 up to 5 x 5) that all pour at once, a bigger square more a block (a 3 x 3 makes it x16.75), up to 50 blocks. Needs power: a share for it and each block.",
